91
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:58,800
Alexandra.

92
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,640
Bye-bye, Alexandra. Thanks.

93
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,600
Bye-bye.

94
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:06,240
Richard! Richard!

95
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,660
You left your bag!

96
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,760
Family Album U.S.A.

97
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,720
It's an album of pictures of the United States.

98
