106
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:11,760
Philip Stewart, Richard's father, is a doctor.

107
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:15,640
He's a pediatrician, a children's doctor.

108
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:22,040
And Richard's mother, Ellen Stewart, is a homemaker.

109
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:28,920
His brother, Robbie, is a student at Riverdale High School.

110
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,800
He's 17.

111
00:07:32,860 --> 00:07:34,680
Richard has one sister.

112
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,320
Her name is Susan.

113
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:39,760
She works for a toy company in New York City.

114
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,920
Malcolm Stewart is Richard's grandfather.

115
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:48,580
He's 72 years old and lives in Florida.

116
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:53,320
And this is Richard's wife, Marilyn Stewart.

117
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,320
She's a fashion designer

118
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:58,680
