119
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:02,200
You'll meet Marilyn Stewart and all the other Stewarts

120
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:04,440
in Family Album U.S.A.

121
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,700
Excuse me, officer. Can you help me?

122
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,440
Sure.

123
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,840
Can you tell me how to get to Linden Street in Riverdale?

124
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:15,320
Richard Stewart, 46 Linden Street, Riverdale, New York.

125
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,200
You should take the number 1 subway.

126
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,840
Is there a station near here?

127
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,560
Yes. The station's that way.

128
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:23,080
You should take the number 1 train to Van Cortlandt Park.

129
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:26,520
Number 1 train to Van Cortlandt Park. Thank you.

130
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,500
Anytime. Good luck.

131
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:30,400
Remember, the number 1 train. The uptown platform.

132
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,680
Thank you.

133
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,320
You're welcome.

134
